  + 'Main idea: ' + V + '. Choose freely whatever style tells it best and stops the scroll in a Facebook feed, for example: bold editorial illustration, flat vector, paper-cut layers, isometric scene, realistic photo scene, clay 3D, collage, minimal geometric, cinematic lighting... with your own camera angle, depth and arrangement. '
  + (NUM ? 'You may feature the number "' + NUM + '" prominently. ' : '')
  + (YC ? 'Follow this request about the image: ' + YC + '. ' : '')
  + 'The title must remain the large, clear, instantly readable focal point.';
const imgPrompt = [
  (ngang ? 'Design a WIDE HORIZONTAL 16:9 cover image (landscape, it will be shown full width on top of a Facebook photo album) for' : 'Design a square 1:1 cover image for') + ' an educational Facebook post of a Vietnamese digital-skills academy. It is a knowledge-sharing post, NOT an advertisement: no call-to-action button, no benefit list, no price, no discount badge. People are welcome whenever they make the story more vivid (for example Vietnamese office workers, students or a teacher): natural, friendly, well-drawn faces and hands, never celebrities or real identifiable persons.',
  'COMPOSITION: ' + LAYOUT,
  'TEXT: a small topic label "' + tag + '" (styled to fit your design, e.g. pill, ribbon or sticker, in brand colors) and the title "' + title + '" in a bold, highly readable sans-serif with correct Vietnamese diacritics; typography, size contrast and color treatment are your choice within the brand colors, with the key words emphasized.',
  'BACKGROUND AND MARGINS (strict): the background (color, texture or scene) runs seamlessly from edge to edge over the whole canvas, with NO bands, boxes, panels, cards, frames, borders or outlines anywhere around the edges or corners. Simply leave generous breathing room: nothing important near the top-left (left third, top fifth) and nothing important in the bottom tenth; the text starts about one fifth down. Keep all text inside safe margins.',
